1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:05,240
Slide 36 diagrams our full Defense-in-Depth architecture!

2
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:13,140
Never rely on a single lock on your door. We build three concentric rings of security.

3
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:23,920
Layer 1 is Input Sanitization. Every external document or webhook payload is scrubbed and validated against strict JSON schemas before touching our model.

4
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:38,830
Layer 2 is Runtime Sandboxing. When the agent runs Python scripts or bash commands, it executes inside an isolated, temporary Docker container with zero access to your root host machine!

5
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:51,340
And Layer 3 is Egress Filtering. The container cannot talk to arbitrary internet servers; outbound traffic is strictly locked to whitelisted Google and enterprise API domains.

6
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:59,340
Even if an attacker somehow bypasses Layer 1, Layers 2 and 3 trap the attack harmlessly.

